# Day 42 needs no secret: sessions are random ids held on the server, so there is nothing to sign.
# Copy this file to .env.local only if you need one of these (it is git-ignored).
#
# Secure cookies work on http://localhost. If you test from a phone or another computer over a
# LAN address such as http://192.168.1.20:3000, the browser refuses them: set this to false
# for that test only, and never in production.
# COOKIE_SECURE=false
